{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bc2ead0dc1cc517785aee176f4967985224a22b34373595b152842f048827a4d", "ja": "（『BlueMoon Harmony!』公演が\n無事に終わった……！　劇場内はすごい声援だ！）", "zh": "（『BlueMoon Harmony!』公演顺利结束了……！\n剧场内的欢呼声真是惊人！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "c58a0fa4ffa2b85a1b088d54c825ccd2d63b24f1b1701ccca00da2421fb12329", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。あら、お疲れ様です、\n{$P$}さん～。", "zh": "呼、呼……哎呀，辛苦了，\n{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1002_p", "source_sha256": "79cc26e3dc36ed99bc0af869808027a59b69ac84a310248750165d1f6cffa6db", "ja": "朋花こそ、よく頑張ったな！　子豚ちゃん達の\n声援も、いつも以上にすごいんじゃないか？", "zh": "朋花你才辛苦了！\n小猪们的声援是不是比平时还要热烈啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1003_kobutachan", "source_sha256": "0ceb8b9dd7c11863f8200127c9f164fc46e6594feb078ed5203337e3bcf72b46", "ja": "うおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおおお！\n朋花さま！　ああ朋花さま！　朋花さまぁっ！！", "zh": "唔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔！\n朋花大人！啊啊！朋花大人！朋花大人！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "3a938186d18d262ca1112c672db4232450069d4586cb632e8a7ca42492734d49", "ja": "ふふっ、確かに今日は、いつもよりたくさん\n鳴いているみたいですね～？", "zh": "呵呵，他们今天确实是\n叫得比平常还要卖命呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "9cd91ae85bab7f503529db54f24a958bc0c3abe090b595d9cb52a76537b35d70", "ja": "きっと私達の公演を見て、\nいろいろな迷いが晴れたのでしょう～♪", "zh": "肯定是看了我们的公演，\n抛去不少心中的迷惘吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1006_p", "source_sha256": "25b54b322793bae155636cd8680324abcd4e7d4df23286e28aa28a7b49897c86", "ja": "ああ、まさに夜空に輝く月のように、ファン……\n子豚ちゃん達を導けたみたいで、なによりだ！", "zh": "是啊，你就像夜空中闪耀的月亮，指引粉丝……\n小猪们走向未来，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca66890221f2baed11abe84b29d9fb7ef95a6b8fec36d2d6d86b684f2d3a5af2", "ja": "…………はぁ。", "zh": "…………唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "5f9808530e77e61089f2402201f0118cfc9bb0aafb4c19f5ebb92450b24167d9", "ja": "それだけですか？", "zh": "就这样而已吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1009_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "396cbce32e36dc097cba3480c3d0811bc2938a4e04338ccb6fead08d9dc9e293", "ja": "プロデューサーとして、私にかける言葉は、\nそれだけですか？　……と、聞いているんですよ～？", "zh": "你身为制作人，要对我说的就只有这些？\n……我是在问你这个～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "90a84a8fbe39f860276d97169c56f9029528f7900c7588afd6128dd9574c6c49", "ja": "（うおっ、なんだこのプレッシャーは！？　えっと、\nプロデューサーとして……プロデューサーとして！？）", "zh": "（哇！这股压力是怎么回事！？我想想，\n身为制作人……身为制作人！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_1012", "source_sha256": "c725e7bbd71f49045a4a5ee1fae292622dcfa60827108a14e71fd99f03338c17", "ja": "アドバイス！", "zh": "建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c8229ce86e885cdc252a0cfc399a784b09d7a881fd482156b36128bb3ae90995", "ja": "そ、そうだな……概ねよかったけど、声援に手を振り\nすぎて、ダンスが遅れたのは反省点……だな、うん。", "zh": "我、我想想……虽然整体上是不错，但你太专心在\n对粉丝挥手导致舞步慢了，得反省……这点吧，嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2001_031tom", "source_sha256": "d47a5c39c607114b30d28f73c322455cc1bcb105005fc1adad986cf5cb78794b", "ja": "ふふっ、ちゃんと見ていたんですね～。\nでは、許してあげましょう♪", "zh": "呵呵，看来你确实有看在眼里呢～\n那我就原谅你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2002_031tom", "source_sha256": "828bdc98acff3371af444559ef91b930be1b60ed9faabb85f52e9412165d6e9d", "ja": "これからも、気になる所は遠慮せずに、\nきちんと言わないとダメですよ～？", "zh": "今后也要毫不避讳地\n对我说出在意的地方才行喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2003_p", "source_sha256": "869fd19759427e9a3dfbd1caa013fe6f501800f477001de7010325f9f9277d96", "ja": "そうだな、ごめんごめん。\nそれじゃ、もう一つだけ……。", "zh": "你说得对，抱歉抱歉。\n那我再补充一个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2004_031tom", "source_sha256": "e56786e53e921c1b839fede8e9d37deb6a8af064981950ffb27861234766a132", "ja": "あら、まだ何かあるんですか？\n私は気づきませんでしたけど……？", "zh": "哎呀，还有什么问题吗？\n我是没有发现就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2005_p", "source_sha256": "632d1491d183ea800f9e632706629101f1876ecd19e01676194b95aff6754f1a", "ja": "いや、ダンスの遅れを取り戻すアドリブの振り付け、\nあれはすごく可愛かったぞ！", "zh": "不是问题，是你补救慢掉的舞步时跳的即兴，\n那个非常可爱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2007_p", "source_sha256": "b3ccaf866b4a88d912b65e9be7353c3c8e5df69bd40ee7aae3655aa2b5acb3a1", "ja": "プロデューサーとして、ちゃんと良かったところも\nホメないとな。ああいうのは、今後も続けていこう！", "zh": "我身为制作人，当然也得称赞你跳得好的地方。\n今后也要维持这样的表现喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2008_031tom", "source_sha256": "35d42bbad43fcec26ea8818648a328cd9bf88925f8374f1b906aa58023dcfb62", "ja": "……聖母を崇拝するのではなく、ほめるだなんて。\n生意気な人ですね～。", "zh": "……你一个凡人居然不崇拜圣母，\n反而是赞赏我，真是狂妄呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2009_031tom", "source_sha256": "e80000027714f1c0541313c06cf8c509c6e60546855f5d4b875f0670cc1bc588", "ja": "あまり調子にのらないように、\n少しお仕置きをしておきましょう～。", "zh": "为了不让你太过放肆，\n稍微惩罚你一下好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2010_p", "source_sha256": "692a3ec9771ee5e48d7b8e6b942acc5258165495e170ce9f77ca96f21fd9c767", "ja": "えっ。……ええっ？", "zh": "咦……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2011_p", "source_sha256": "32a745f59b25baf1d9e2e97a77cf55d7a7cf227103a1e1d04f139ecf904889c0", "ja": "（朋花のお仕置きで、その後メンバー全員のために\n美味しいジュースを買いに行くことになり……）", "zh": "（我遭到朋花惩罚，\n被命令去帮所有人买好喝的饮料回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0083_2012_p", "source_sha256": "59d2dee8fa89b40ddb27c145aaad8df3d74d8df7f99ca5604dd218bdecbf21aa", "ja": "（開いている店を求めて夜の街を彷徨う俺を、\n空の月は、いつまでも見守っていた）", "zh": "（唯有高挂天上的明月，\n照着夜晚在大街上徘徊寻求商家的我。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
